#: ../../source/getting_started/environment_setup.md:6
msgid "Development Environment Setup"
msgstr "搭建开发环境"

#: ../../source/getting_started/environment_setup.md:8
msgid ""
"This chapter describes how to install and configure the UniSDK "
"development environment. The recommended approach is to use the Telink VS"
" Code Extension, which provides a graphical interface for managing "
"dependencies. Alternatively, you can set up the environment from the "
"command line."
msgstr ""
"本章介绍如何安装和配置 UniSDK 开发环境。推荐使用 Telink VS Code 扩展，"
"它提供了图形界面来管理依赖项。另外，您也可以通过命令行来搭建环境。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/environment_setup.md:10
msgid "VS Code Extension (Recommended)"
msgstr "VS Code 扩展（推荐）"

#: ../../source/getting_started/environment_setup.md:12
msgid ""
"The **Telink Development Tool** VS Code Extension provides a graphical "
"interface for installing dependencies, managing the toolchain, and "
"initializing the workspace with a single click."
msgstr ""
"**Telink Development Tool** VS Code 扩展提供图形界面，可一键安装依赖项、"
"管理工具链和初始化工作区。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/environment_setup.md:14
msgid "Prerequisites"
msgstr "前提条件"

#: ../../source/getting_started/environment_setup.md:16
msgid ""
"**VS Code**: Install the latest version of [Visual Studio "
"Code](https://code.visualstudio.com/)."
msgstr ""
"**VS Code**：安装最新版本的 [Visual Studio Code](https://code.visualstudio.com/)。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/environment_setup.md:18
msgid ""
"If your VS Code version is not the latest, the extension may not work "
"properly or some features may not function as expected."
msgstr ""
"如果您的 VS Code 不是最新版本，扩展可能无法正常工作，或者某些功能可能"
"不符合预期。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/environment_setup.md:20
msgid "Step 1: Install the Telink VS Code Extension"
msgstr "第 1 步：安装 Telink VS Code 扩展"

#: ../../source/getting_started/environment_setup.md:22
msgid "Launch VS Code."
msgstr "启动 VS Code。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/environment_setup.md:23
msgid ""
"Click the **Extensions** icon in the left activity bar (or press "
"**Ctrl+Shift+X**)."
msgstr ""
"单击左侧活动栏中的**Extensions**图标（或按 **Ctrl+Shift+X**）。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/environment_setup.md:24
msgid "Search for **Telink**."
msgstr "搜索 **Telink**。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/environment_setup.md:25
msgid "Find **Telink Development Tool** in the results and click **Install**."
msgstr "在结果中找到 **Telink Development Tool**，然后单击 **Install**。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/environment_setup.md:27
msgid "![Telink DEVELOPMENT Icon](pics/telink_development_icon.png)"
msgstr "![Telink DEVELOPMENT 图标](pics/telink_development_icon.png)"

#: ../../source/getting_started/environment_setup.md:27
msgid "Telink DEVELOPMENT Icon"
msgstr "Telink DEVELOPMENT 图标"

#: ../../source/getting_started/environment_setup.md:29
msgid ""
"After installation, a **Telink DEVELOPMENT** icon will appear on the left"
" sidebar."
msgstr ""
"安装完成后，左侧边栏将出现 **Telink DEVELOPMENT** 图标。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/environment_setup.md:31
msgid ""
"To facilitate automatic identification of the Unified SDK by subsequent "
"tools, open the Unified SDK folder in VS Code after completing the "
"installation."
msgstr ""
"为方便后续工具自动识别 Unified SDK，请在安装完成后在 VS Code 中打开"
"Unified SDK 文件夹。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/environment_setup.md:33
msgid "Step 2: Install Dependencies via the Extension"
msgstr "第 2 步：通过扩展安装依赖项"

#: ../../source/getting_started/environment_setup.md:35
msgid "Click the **Telink DEVELOPMENT** button in the left sidebar."
msgstr "单击左侧边栏中的 **Telink DEVELOPMENT** 按钮。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/environment_setup.md:36
msgid ""
"In the **DEVELOPMENT TOOLS** tree, you will see the required components: "
"**Toolchain**, **West**, **CMake**, and **Ninja**."
msgstr ""
"在 **DEVELOPMENT TOOLS** 树中，您将看到所需的组件：**Toolchain**、"
"**West**、**CMake** 和 **Ninja**。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/environment_setup.md:37
msgid "Install each component:"
msgstr "安装每个组件："

#: ../../source/getting_started/environment_setup.md:38
msgid "**Toolchain**: Click the toolchain entry and select **Install Toolchain**."
msgstr "**Toolchain**：单击工具链条目并选择 **Install Toolchain**。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/environment_setup.md:39
msgid ""
"**West**: Right-click **West** and select **Install**. We recommend using"
" a Python virtual environment for West."
msgstr ""
"**West**：右键单击 **West** 并选择 **Install**。建议为 West 使用 Python "
"虚拟环境。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/environment_setup.md:40
msgid "**CMake**: Right-click **CMake** and select **Install**."
msgstr "**CMake**：右键单击 **CMake** 并选择 **Install**。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/environment_setup.md:41
msgid "**Ninja**: Right-click **Ninja** and select **Install**."
msgstr "**Ninja**：右键单击 **Ninja** 并选择 **Install**。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/environment_setup.md:43
msgid ""
"![Dependency Installation](pics/dependency_installation.png) ![Dependency"
" Installation Success](pics/dependency_installation_success.png)"
msgstr ""
"![依赖安装](pics/dependency_installation.png) ![依赖安装成功](pics/dependency_installation_success.png)"

#: ../../source/getting_started/environment_setup.md:43
msgid "Dependency Installation"
msgstr "依赖安装"

#: ../../source/getting_started/environment_setup.md:43
msgid "Dependency Installation Success"
msgstr "依赖安装成功"

#: ../../source/getting_started/environment_setup.md:46
msgid ""
"Wait for each component to finish installing. A notification appears in "
"the bottom-right corner when installation is complete."
msgstr ""
"等待每个组件安装完成。安装完成后，右下角会出现通知提示。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/environment_setup.md:48
msgid "Step 3: Initialize the West Workspace"
msgstr "第 3 步：初始化 West 工作区"

#: ../../source/getting_started/environment_setup.md:50
msgid "In the **Telink DEVELOPMENT** view, locate the **West Command** section."
msgstr "在 **Telink DEVELOPMENT** 视图中，找到 **West Command** 部分。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/environment_setup.md:51
msgid "Click the **init** button."
msgstr "单击 **init** 按钮。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/environment_setup.md:53
msgid "![West Init](pics/west_init.png)"
msgstr "![West 初始化](pics/west_init.png)"

#: ../../source/getting_started/environment_setup.md:53
msgid "West Init"
msgstr "West 初始化"

#: ../../source/getting_started/environment_setup.md:55
msgid ""
"Check the **OUTPUT** terminal panel. A confirmation message appears when "
"initialization completes successfully."
msgstr ""
"查看 **OUTPUT** 终端面板。初始化成功完成后将显示确认消息。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/environment_setup.md:57
msgid "![West Init Success](pics/west_init_success.png)"
msgstr "![West 初始化成功](pics/west_init_success.png)"

#: ../../source/getting_started/environment_setup.md:57
msgid "West Init Success"
msgstr "West 初始化成功"

#: ../../source/getting_started/environment_setup.md:59
msgid "Step 4: Verify the Environment"
msgstr "第 4 步：验证环境"

#: ../../source/getting_started/environment_setup.md:61
msgid "In the **West Command** section, click the **tl-build** button."
msgstr "在 **West Command** 部分，单击 **tl-build** 按钮。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/environment_setup.md:62
msgid ""
"A linker error is expected because no source directory has been "
"configured yet. This indicates that the toolchain, build system, and West"
" environment are configured correctly."
msgstr ""
"出现链接器错误是预期的行为，因为尚未配置源目录。这表示工具链、构建系统和"
"West 环境已正确配置。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/environment_setup.md:64
msgid "![Expected Linker Error](pics/expected_linker_error.png)"
msgstr "![预期的链接器错误](pics/expected_linker_error.png)"

#: ../../source/getting_started/environment_setup.md:64
msgid "Expected Linker Error"
msgstr "预期的链接器错误"

#: ../../source/getting_started/environment_setup.md:67
msgid "CLI Setup (Alternative)"
msgstr "CLI 方式搭建（备选）"

#: ../../source/getting_started/environment_setup.md:69
msgid ""
"If you prefer to set up the development environment from the command "
"line, refer to the platform-specific guides:"
msgstr ""
"如果您更倾向于通过命令行搭建开发环境，请参阅各平台指南："

#: ../../source/getting_started/environment_setup.md:71
msgid "[Linux Environment Setup](../developing/setup_linux.md)"
msgstr "[Linux 环境搭建](../developing/setup_linux.md)"

#: ../../source/getting_started/environment_setup.md:72
msgid "[Windows Environment Setup](../developing/setup_windows.md)"
msgstr "[Windows 环境搭建](../developing/setup_windows.md)"

#: ../../source/getting_started/environment_setup.md:73
msgid "[macOS Environment Setup](../developing/setup_macos.md)"
msgstr "[macOS 环境搭建](../developing/setup_macos.md)"

#: ../../source/getting_started/environment_setup.md:75
msgid "Next Steps"
msgstr "下一步"

#: ../../source/getting_started/environment_setup.md:77
msgid ""
"After completing the environment setup, proceed to [Get and Import the "
"SDK](get_sdk.md)."
msgstr ""
"完成环境搭建后，请继续[获取和导入 SDK](get_sdk.md)。"
